message: "If you use PySAEM, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PySAEM: nonlinear mixed-effects models of ordinary differential equations in Python"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-11-25"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/RomainFerrara/pysaem"
url: "https://pysaem.readthedocs.io"
authors:
  - family-names: Ferrara
    given-names: Romain
    affiliation: "COMPO, Inria Center at University Côte d'Azur, Cancer Research Center of Marseille; Department of Nuclear Medicine, Institut Paoli-Calmettes, Marseille"
  - family-names: Benzekry
